  <h2>OTP Security Best Practices</h2>
  <p>
    While OTP codes provide crucial security benefits, proper precautions are necessary to prevent interception or misuse:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Never Share OTPs Over the Phone:</strong> Legitimate customer support representatives will never ask you to read out an authentication code or password reset token.</li>
    <li><strong>Verify the Sending Domain:</strong> Inspect the sender domain to ensure you are entering codes into the legitimate application rather than a cloned phishing site.</li>
